<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<BugInfo xmlns="http://www.codesafe.cn/schema/rules" id="0202000010090001" language="Java">
			<Type>bug</Type>
			<Categories>
				<Category type="ClassChin">CWE</Category>
				<Category type="SubClassChin">资源管理</Category>
				<Category type="DetailClassChin">线程锁定状态下调用sleep()</Category>
			</Categories>
			<BugServerity>1</BugServerity>
			<DynamicDescription><![CDATA[<p th:if="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的+'`'+${funcName}+'`'+方法中的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行在线程锁定状态下调用sleep()。" th:remove="tag"></p>
<p th:unless="${funcNameisEmpty}" th:text="在+'`'+${fileName}+'`'+的第+'`'+${line}+'`'+行在线程锁定状态下调用sleep()。" th:remove="tag"></p>]]></DynamicDescription>
			<Description><![CDATA[线程锁定情况下，调用线程的`sleep()`方法可能会导致程序性能下降，甚至可能导致死锁。   
  
**例如**：下列代码片段中，保持线程锁定情况下调用了`sleep()`方法。  
```java
ReentrantLock rl = new ReentrantLock();  
...  
rl.lock();  
Thread.sleep(500);  
...  
rl.unlock();
```
]]></Description>
			<Advice><![CDATA[程序中应避免线程锁定的情况下，调用线程的`sleep()`方法。
]]></Advice>
			<References>
				<Reference type="CWE">557:Concurrency Issues</Reference>
				<Reference type="CERT">LCK09-J:Do not perform operations that can block while holding a lock</Reference>
				<Reference type="OWASP TOP 10">2004:A9 Application Denial of Service</Reference>
				<Reference type="SJ/T 11683-2017">6.8.4 持锁时调用sleep方法</Reference>
			</References>
			<Obsolete>not</Obsolete>
			<Default>yes</Default>
			<WhiteList>not</WhiteList>
			<Security>not</Security>



			<Tag>performance,bad_practice</Tag>
			<DomainType>bug</DomainType>
		</BugInfo>
		